.TH AVR\-BILLING\-UPDATE\-SETTINGS 1 "" "avr 0.1.5" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-billing-update-settings \- Update billing settings.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr billing update-settings
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update billing settings.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr billing update-settings --email billing@example.com
    avr billing update-settings --tax-id EU123456789
    avr billing update-settings --email a@example.com,b@example.com --tax-id FI12345678
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    billing_address, billing_emails, metronome_customer_id,
    stripe_customer_id, tax_id
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-email\fR \fITEXT\fR
Billing email address(es), comma-separated.
.TP
\fB\-\-tax\-id\fR \fITEXT\fR
Tax ID (e.g. VAT number).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-billing (1),
.BR avr-billing-invoices (1),
.BR avr-billing-payment-methods (1),
.BR avr-billing-settings (1),
.BR avr-billing-summary (1)
